		(property "Assembly Note" "MECHANICAL TBD / NOT PRODUCTION RELEASED. J1 is nine bare straight 0.64 x 0.64 mm square contacts on 4.00 mm pitch in provisional 1.00 mm plated holes. Each contact projects 16.00 mm beyond the PCB-edge datum: the inner 8.00 mm is reserved for capture, alignment and lateral support by the future printed nose; only the outermost 8.00 mm is the console mating/insertion section. Exact purchasable pin MPN, tail/retention geometry, plating and assembly method remain TBD pending connector-only coupon fit testing. The 1.70 mm pads are provisional. The shell must carry mating loads. No donor plug, cable, wires or female socket terminals."
